  "prefLabel": "Phy 302.06 Federation of State Boards of Physical Therapy (FSBPT)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Phy 302.06 “Federation of State Boards of Physical Therapy (FSBPT)” means the entity that develops the national examination for physical therapists and physical therapist assistants, or its successor.\n\nSource. #9233, eff 8-22-08; ss by #10933, eff 9-18-15; ss by #12864, eff 9-10-19; ss by #14563, eff 6-20-26, EXPIRES: 6-20-36",
